- 我撒了个大…… 哦，你能说我一直在撒谎吗？
Why for you?
- I lied for... oh, can you say I lied for ages?

569
00:32:24,800 --> 00:32:25,900
(笑声)
(Laughter)

570
00:32:25,900 --> 00:32:28,500
如果你现在不是在撒谎，我想我们还能这么玩。  
- 我没有。
If you're not lying now,
I think we can get way with it.
- I'm not.

571
00:32:28,500 --> 00:32:32,500
我曾是个老师，几年都不出门。
I was a schoolteacher
who never left the house for a few years.

572
00:32:32,700 --> 00:32:34,200
(笑声)
(Laughter)

573
00:32:35,400 --> 00:32:39,400
但后来我上了电视，我想我得做好点儿，因为这有点……
But then when I got on the telly,
I thought I'd better, because it is a bit...

574
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:42,100
我想，如果哪天我撞了人，他们发现是我，
I thought, if I ever run anyone over,
and they realize it was me,

575
00:32:42,100 --> 00:32:45,900
我大概得倒车把他们干掉。（笑声）
I'd probablt have to reverse and kill them.
(Laughter)

576
00:32:45,900 --> 00:32:48,700
呃，你前几天把杰米·奥利弗请进了你的车里。
Um, you had Jamie Oliver in your car
the other day.

577
00:32:48,700 --> 00:32:50,700
不，你其实坐的是杰米·奥利弗的车。
No, you were in Jamie Oliver's car, you see.

578
00:32:50,700 --> 00:32:53,200
是啊，我们是。他把我们带到野外去。
Yeah, we were. He took us off-road.

579
00:32:53,200 --> 00:32:56,800
上车前，他给我们每人一只垃圾袋，
Before we got in the car,
he gave us a bin liner each to put on,

580
00:32:56,800 --> 00:32:58,700
还说：“这东西你们会用到的。”
and he said "You'll need those."

581
00:32:58,700 --> 00:33:01,000
天哪，他到底想干什么？
What was he going to do to you,
for God's sake?

582
00:33:01,000 --> 00:33:02,500
(笑声) 那就说是开头了。
(Laughter)
Well then, that was the start.

583
00:33:02,500 --> 00:33:06,500
然后他给我们俩塞了一个巨大的奶油派，
And then he gave us both like
a massive cream pie

584
00:33:06,600 --> 00:33:08,300
还有一大壶水。
and big jugs of water.

585
00:33:08,300 --> 00:33:10,400
他说：“系好安全带，咱们要出发了。”
Said "Buckle up, we're going for a ride."

586
00:33:10,400 --> 00:33:14,800
等一下。抱歉。杰米·奥利弗请你去他家，这到底是——？  
- 是的。
Hold on. I'm sorry. Jamie Oliver invites
you down to his house, is this-?
- Yeah.

587
00:33:14,800 --> 00:33:19,400
然后让你装着奶油派，穿着垃圾袋坐他的路虎？
and then makes you go in his Land Rover
in a bin liner with a cream pie?

588
00:33:19,400 --> 00:33:21,700
这不是给电视拍的吧？  
- 是的，还有个变态面具。
And this isn't for television-?
- Yes, and a gimp mask.

589
00:33:21,700 --> 00:33:24,000
是啊。（笑声）
Yeah.
(Laughter)

590
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:25,200
还有个变态面具？  
- 不，那是撒谎。
And a gimp mask?
- No, that's a lie.

591
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:27,500
他吃太多野草了，这才是问题所在。
He's been eating too many weeds,
that's the trouble.

592
00:33:27,500 --> 00:33:29,600
我们到处跑，是吧？
And we go all over, didn't we?

593
00:33:29,600 --> 00:33:35,400
上下跑，谁的派和那玩意儿、还有水最多，谁就赢。
Up and down, and whoever had the most pie
and thing, and water in the thing won.

594
00:33:35,400 --> 00:33:36,700
所以，我们就这样。
So, we're like this.

595
00:33:36,700 --> 00:33:38,500
我把你砸得满脸都是玻璃，还不是？
I've glassed you, haven't I?

596
00:33:38,500 --> 00:33:39,800
(笑声)  
- 脸上，
(Laughter)
- In the face,

597
00:33:39,800 --> 00:33:43,800
我把，呃，蛋糕的大部分当成胸针戴在身上。（笑声）
I'm wearing, er, most of the cake
as a brooch. (Laughter)

598
00:33:45,000 --> 00:33:47,100
我的奶油派全撒在他的大腿上。
I got my cream pie all in his lap.

599
00:33:47,100 --> 00:33:48,300
不错。
Nice.

600
00:33:48,300 --> 00:33:50,300
结果我的晚餐——（笑声）
It turns out my dinner-
(Laughter)

601
00:33:50,300 --> 00:33:52,800
……我的晚宴全是糟糕透了。
...my dinner parties are all wrong.

602
00:33:52,800 --> 00:33:58,300
现在，你们的节目从《Friday Night Project》变成了《Sunday Night Project》了。
Now, your show was the Friday Night Project,
is now the Sunday Night Project.

603
00:33:58,300 --> 00:34:01,200
所以，你们拿工资主持这个节目，
So, you're paid to host this show,

604
00:34:01,200 --> 00:34:04,100
然后还找别人来接管主持。
and then you get someone else
to come and host the show.

605
00:34:04,100 --> 00:34:06,500
是啊。
- 对。真是管用。
Yeah.
- Yes. It really works.

606
00:34:06,500 --> 00:34:08,700
（笑声）
(Laughter)

607
00:34:08,700 --> 00:34:12,000
对我来说真烦人。我们得给理查德和詹姆斯付钱，
It's annoying that, for me.
We have to pay Richard and James,

608
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:14,400
他们现在只会滚蛋，还在外面抽烟。
who just bugger off at this point,
and smoke outside.

609
00:34:14,400 --> 00:34:17,300
好吧，其实詹姆斯不抽烟。
他妈显然不知道。
Well, no, James doesn't smoke.
His mother doesn't know, obviously.

610
00:34:17,300 --> 00:34:18,600
（笑声）
(Laughter)

611
00:34:18,600 --> 00:34:25,600
另外一点是，你们得跟客串主持耗上好长时间。
Now, the other one as well is, you spend a
long time with the guest hosts on your show.

612
00:34:25,600 --> 00:34:27,200
是啊。
- 他们是噩梦吗？
Yeah.
- Are they a nightmare?

613
00:34:27,200 --> 00:34:29,300
史蒂文·西格尔当时有点硬核，不是吗？
Steven Seagal was a bit hard, weren't he?

614
00:34:29,300 --> 00:34:32,500
他一进来说的第一句话是：“你们俩是（哔——）吗？”
The first thing he said when he came in
"Are you two (BLEEP)?"

615
00:34:32,500 --> 00:34:35,300
（笑声）
(Laughter)

616
00:34:36,200 --> 00:34:39,500
我当时回：“荣幸，西格尔先生，你真是机智！”
I was like, "Enchanté, Mr. Seagal,
you're so witty!"

617
00:34:39,500 --> 00:34:43,500
那句全给哔——了。他说的是…性交——你们俩…
That was all bleeped. What he said
was fornicating - are you two...

618
00:34:43,800 --> 00:34:46,400
哦，已经哔——了，抱歉。
- 没事，没事。
Oh, they've bleeped it. Sorry.
- No, it's all right.

619
00:34:46,400 --> 00:34:49,000
我们装作答应，只是想捉弄他。
- 是的，我们是。
We said yes just to mess with his mind.
- Yes, we are.

620
00:34:49,000 --> 00:34:51,000
是的，我们是。想不想看看？
Yes, we are. Would you like to see?

621
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:53,700
想象一下孩子们的表情。
（笑声）
Imagine the children.
(Laughter)

622
00:34:53,700 --> 00:34:58,100
现在，轮次来了。显然这很不寻常，我们有两个人而不是一个，
Now, your laps. Obviously this is an unusual
thing, as we've got two people rather than one,

623
00:34:58,100 --> 00:35:01,400
所以不只是问，你们觉得自己打败了谁？
so it isn't just a question of,
who do you think you've beaten here?

624
00:35:01,400 --> 00:35:03,400
谁想先来？
Who wants to go first?

625
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:05,400
艾伦。
- 艾伦？
Alan.
- Alan?

626
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:06,700
你先来。
- 不要，艾伦。
You go first.
- No, Alan.

627
00:35:06,700 --> 00:35:09,700
不好意思，
我也不知道为什么问你，
因为你们会按机器里的顺序上场。
Unfortunately,
I don't know why I asked you that,

628
00:35:09,700 --> 00:35:12,100
哦，对了。
cos you'll go in whichever order
they are in the machine.

629
00:35:12,100 --> 00:35:13,300
所以我们从……开始，我根本不知道会是谁，结果是……
Oh, right.

630
00:35:13,300 --> 00:35:16,900
（此处略去空白）
So we're starting with... I've no idea
who it's going to be and it is...

631
00:35:18,200 --> 00:35:20,400
那是谁？
会是谁呢？
- 是谁啊？
Who's that?
Who could it be?
- Who is it?

632
00:35:20,400 --> 00:35:21,900
快点，布里斯托尔飞侠！
Come on, Bristol Flyer!

633
00:35:21,900 --> 00:35:23,000
是你！
It's you!

634
00:35:23,000 --> 00:35:27,000
这次比你热身时更成功？
More successful this time
than you were in the warm-up laps?

635
00:35:27,300 --> 00:35:29,000
来看看吧。
现在正冲向第一个弯。这样切入会让车子不稳……不，不——
Let's have a look.
Coming up to the first

636
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:32,700
哎呀！
corner now. Cutting it like that
unstabilises the car... no, no-

637
00:35:32,700 --> 00:35:34,000
就这么搞定！
- 天啊，太惊险了！
Ooh!

638
00:35:34,000 --> 00:35:36,400
（你对这个满意？）
芝加哥。这次再来一次？
That's it!
- God, that was close!

639
00:35:36,400 --> 00:35:39,200
这车开得真疯狂！
(You were happy with that?)
Chicago. Go off again this time?

640
00:35:39,500 --> 00:35:41,500
（此处结束）
This is a wild drive!

641
00:35:41,500 --> 00:35:44,700
我是个狂野的家伙。
# 我的，我的黛莉拉…
I'm a wild man.
# My, my Delilah...

642
00:35:46,300 --> 00:35:49,100
好了，来到这里，这台Hammerhead，
它可是个棘手的玩意儿。
Right, here we are, the Hammerhead,
it's the tricky one.

643
00:35:50,400 --> 00:35:55,700
我们现在用秒表计时，你在那儿的成绩是1分05秒。
We've now got a stopwatch as you cross this line
there. You were at one minute five seconds.

644
00:35:55,700 --> 00:35:58,500
# 我看到了闪烁的灯光…
# I saw the flickering lights...

645
00:36:00,200 --> 00:36:04,000
这太快了，我被震撼了。
- 不，这垃圾——真的？
This is quick. I'm impressed by this.
- Nah, that's rubbish- really?

646
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:09,100
# 她是我的女人
- 我才不在乎呢。
# She was my woman
- I'm not impressed by that.

647
00:36:09,100 --> 00:36:11,800
(Laughter)
(Laughter)

648
00:36:11,800 --> 00:36:15,300
#…看着把我逼疯了#
#...watched and went out of my mind #

649
00:36:15,300 --> 00:36:18,200
然后进了倒数第二个弯。
- 哦不不不…
And into the second to last corner.
- Ooh, no no no...

650
00:36:19,300 --> 00:36:21,300
接下来出现的是Gambon。
And coming up now, it's Gambon next.

651
00:36:21,300 --> 00:36:25,700
来了。宽的，你已经跑偏了，
已经跑出界线，但你还是冲过去。
There it is. Wide, you've gone wide there,
it's gone but you go across the line.

652
00:36:25,700 --> 00:36:27,700
(Applause)
- 现在。
(Applause)
- Now.

653
00:36:28,600 --> 00:36:30,600
慢。
- 不，你才不是！
Slow.
- No, you weren't!

654
00:36:30,600 --> 00:36:32,000
太慢了。
It's slow.

655
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:34,100
我还没把Gambon甩掉。
I haven't beaten Gambon.

656
00:36:34,100 --> 00:36:35,800
我还没打败Gambon，那太慢了。
I haven't beaten Gambon, that was slow.

657
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:41,900
你搞到了……1分50……
You did it... one minute fifty... one...

658
00:36:41,900 --> 00:36:43,600
啊！
…点八。
Ah!
...point eight.

659
00:36:43,600 --> 00:36:46,600
所以，你去给他
来一阵掌声，大家，
So, you go and give him
a round of applause, everyone,

660
00:36:46,600 --> 00:36:50,600
因为他比海伦·米伦还快。
(Applause)
because he's done it faster than Helen Mirren.
(Applause)

661
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:52,800
海伦·米伦？
- 你打败了海伦·米伦。
Helen Mirren?
- You beat Helen Mirren.

662
00:36:52,800 --> 00:36:54,100
干得好！
Well done!

663
00:36:57,400 --> 00:37:00,500
你正式成为比海伦·米伦更快的司机。
You are officially a faster driver
than Helen Mirren.

664
00:37:00,500 --> 00:37:03,400
这大概是我能和海伦·米伦沾边的极限了。我爱海伦·米伦。
That's probably as close to Helen Mirren
as I'm ever gonna get. I love Helen Mirren.

665
00:37:03,400 --> 00:37:05,300
好好享受吧，你还会在那儿久挂一阵子。
Enjoy it, you could be there a while.

666
00:37:05,300 --> 00:37:07,400
谢谢。
- 好了，我们来看看你的单圈吧？
Thank you.
- Now, shall we have a look at your lap?

667
00:37:07,400 --> 00:37:10,500
是啊！
- 大家准备好了吗？放录像吧。
Yeah!
- Ready, everybody? Play the tape.

668
00:37:12,500 --> 00:37:14,400
哎呀，已经出错了。
Oh, dear, he's gone wrong already.

669
00:37:14,400 --> 00:37:15,800
是手刹的毛病。
It's the handbrake.

670
00:37:15,800 --> 00:37:17,000
(Laughter)
(Laughter)

671
00:37:17,000 --> 00:37:19,600
我们出发了。说到…
And we're off. Having said...

672
00:37:19,600 --> 00:37:21,600
哦不，停！
Oh, no, stop!

673
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:24,400
现在，看起来…
Now, this is looking...

674
00:37:25,600 --> 00:37:27,600
“慢”是我想说的词吧。
"slow" is the word I'm looking for, I think.

675
00:37:27,600 --> 00:37:29,200
(Alan) 我以为自己挺快的。
(Alan) I thought I was quite fast.

676
00:37:29,200 --> 00:37:31,500
真干净。
- (哔——)
That's tidy.
- (Bleep)

677
00:37:31,500 --> 00:37:32,800
(Laughter)
(Laughter)

678
00:37:34,600 --> 00:37:37,200
不，这东西真的很干净。
No, what it is, what this is is tidy.

679
00:37:37,200 --> 00:37:40,100
啊，斯提格会为我这次感到自豪的。
Aw, Stig's gonna be so proud of me
for that one.

680
00:37:40,100 --> 00:37:41,300
(Laughter)
(Laughter)

681
00:37:41,300 --> 00:37:44,500
你肯定在听斯提格的说辞吧？
You definitely were listening to the Stig,
weren't you?

682
00:37:44,500 --> 00:37:45,700
是啊，他……是啊。
Yeah, he... yeah.

683
00:37:45,700 --> 00:37:47,600
你看，越慢走……
You see, the slower you go...

684
00:37:47,600 --> 00:37:51,500
因为他跟我说，要在高速阶段挂到四档，
Cos he told me, he said go up to
fourth gear for the fast bits,

685
00:37:51,500 --> 00:37:52,800
这简直是个大发现。
and it was a revelation.

686
00:37:52,800 --> 00:37:54,700
没错，看，第四档来了。- 我已经进四档了，懂吧。
It is, there we go, this is fourth gear.
- I'm in fourth, you see.

687
00:37:54,700 --> 00:37:57,600
四档，依旧是四档。
Fourth, still fourth.

688
00:37:58,700 --> 00:38:01,600
哇，真快！- 他跟我说的是四档。- 太神奇了。
Whoa, that is quick!
- He told me fourth gear.
- That's amazing.

689
00:38:01,600 --> 00:38:04,500
真快。现在我们来到倒数第二个弯。
That is quick. Now we've got
the second to last corner.

690
00:38:04,500 --> 00:38:06,700
(Alan) 我看起来像《巴士上的Olive》里的那个Olive。
(Alan) I look like Olive from on The Buses.

691
00:38:06,700 --> 00:38:08,700
(笑声) - 你懂的，她坐在那辆侧车里。
(Laughter)
- You know, she's in that sidecar.

692
00:38:08,700 --> 00:38:12,100
好了，他已经冲过终点线，冲过去了。
Here we go and he's across the line,
he's made it.

693
00:38:12,100 --> 00:38:15,200
(掌声) - 好啊。真快，比你还快。
(Applause)
- Good. That was quick. Quicker than yours.

694
00:38:15,200 --> 00:38:16,500
绝对快。
Definitely quicker.

695
00:38:18,100 --> 00:38:21,500
亚军1分50秒，绝对。真快。
Sub-1:50, definitely. That was quick.

696
00:38:21,500 --> 00:38:22,600
准备好了吗？
Ready?

697
00:38:22,600 --> 00:38:24,200
你的是多少？一分五十一秒……
What was yours? One fifty one...

698
00:38:24,200 --> 00:38:25,600
点八。
Point eight.

699
00:38:25,600 --> 00:38:27,700
你是1分51秒……
You were one fifty one...

700
00:38:29,300 --> 00:38:31,500
……两秒。- 哦！
...two.
- Oh!

701
00:38:31,500 --> 00:38:33,100
你是最快的。- 啊！
You are the quickest.
- Ah!

702
00:38:33,100 --> 00:38:35,500
(掌声) - 给他来个大掌声，大家。
(Applause)
- Give him a big hand, everybody.

703
00:38:36,600 --> 00:38:39,000
看看这玩意儿。
Have a look at that.

704
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:40,400
天呐，太棒了！- 你跑得比雷·温斯顿还快！
Oh my God, yeah!
- You're faster than Ray Winstone!

705
00:38:42,100 --> 00:38:44,200
哦，谢谢。天啊！
Oh, thank you. Oh, my God!

706
00:38:44,200 --> 00:38:48,100
你觉得丢脸吗？- 是啊，我被一个更强的人打败了。
Are you feeling humiliated?
- Yes, I was beaten by a much better man.

707
00:38:48,100 --> 00:38:51,000
我当时在听Smooth FM，放松得不行。
I was listening to a bit of Smooth FM,
that was chilling me out.

708
00:38:51,000 --> 00:38:54,000
不过，你的起步真的超顺滑，完美切线。
But it was, you had a really smooth start,
bang on the lines.

709
00:38:54,000 --> 00:38:57,300
哦，是啊。- 超顺滑，看起来慢，其实更快。
Oh, yes.
- Really smooth, looked slow, is faster.

710
00:38:57,300 --> 00:39:00,800
看起来慢，却更快——真是太妙了，我得写进墓碑上。- 嗯。
Looked slow, is faster - what a lovely thing,
I'll put that on my gravestone.
- Yeah.

711
00:39:00,800 --> 00:39:02,300
(笑声)
(Laughter)

712
00:39:02,300 --> 00:39:04,400
“他看起来慢，但其实开得飞快。”哈哈哈。
"He looks slow but he drove fast." Hahaha.

713
00:39:04,400 --> 00:39:07,600
听着，伙计们，有你们真是太开心了。
Listen, guys, it's been an absolute joy
having you here.

714
00:39:07,600 --> 00:39:10,100
各位观众，JLC和Alan Carr！
Ladies and gentlemen, JLC and Alan Carr!

715
00:39:10,100 --> 00:39:12,200
(掌声) - 非常感谢。
(Applause)
- Thank you so much.

716
00:39:17,000 --> 00:39:22,900
现在，你们知道那些警匪、追车、行动、停火、紧急节目吧？
