(杰里米) 我是第一个到的。
(Jeremy) I was the first to arrive.

737
00:40:36,000 --> 00:40:39,800
好的，我这儿这辆是菲亚特轿跑。
OK, what I've got here is a Fiat Coupé.

738
00:40:39,800 --> 00:40:45,600
花了£900买的，这样警察可以用这钱买十辆这种车，
Paid £900 for it, so the police could buy
getting on for ten of these,

739
00:40:45,600 --> 00:40:47,600
只要一辆Astra的价钱，
for the cost of one Astra,

740
00:40:47,600 --> 00:40:50,800
而且它是20气门五缸涡轮版，
and this is the 20-valve five-cylinder
turbo version,

741
00:40:50,800 --> 00:40:53,900
最高时速能到152英里。
so it does 152 miles an hour.

742
00:40:53,900 --> 00:40:58,300
当然，如果它上了那些警车撞车节目，
And of course, if it were ever to appear on
