00:41:38,400 --> 00:41:40,300
这车没毛病！- 还没到。
There's nothing wrong with it!
- Not yet.

760
00:41:40,300 --> 00:41:43,700
我们的争论于是嘎然而止。
Our argument was then brought
to a shuddering halt.

761
00:41:43,700 --> 00:41:46,500
（笑）
- 就是啊！
(Laughs)
