791
00:43:28,600 --> 00:43:30,600
♪ 丹尼尔·凯恩交响乐团 - 《卡格尼与雷西》主题曲 ♪
♪ Daniel Caine Orchestra -
Theme from "Cagney and Lacey" ♪

792
00:43:30,700 --> 00:43:34,100
（詹姆斯） 几天过去，刷了好几锅油漆后，我们准备就绪，
(James) A few days, and several pots of paint
later, we were ready,

