What happens if you just
pull up next to the pavement

806
00:44:18,150 --> 00:44:19,900
而且有一些女人
还有孩子在四处走动？
and there are some women
and children walking about?

807
00:44:19,900 --> 00:44:21,400
他们的腿会被砍下来。
They'll have their legs cut off.

808
