“在监狱里没人能听到你的尖叫”——毛骨悚然。
"In jail no one can hear you scream" - scary.

809
00:44:24,100 --> 00:44:26,700
博阿迪斯亚的轮胎配件——惊人。
Boadicea wheel attachments - scary.

810
00:44:26,700 --> 00:44:29,000
你大概啥也没有吧。
You, presumably, have nothing.

811
00:44:29,000 --> 00:44:31,400
错——这四个喷嘴…
Wrong - these four nozzles...

812
00:44:31,400 --> 00:44:33,200
…其实是喷漆枪。
- 是啊。是啊。
...are paint guns.
- Yeah. Yeah.

813
00:44:33,200 --> 00:44:36,300
