00:45:01,700 --> 00:45:04,200
不，他们停车买冰淇淋
结果被抓了。
—要不要来点儿？
No, they stop for an ice cream
and then they're nicked.
- May I?

822
00:45:04,200 --> 00:45:06,800
我的那个更高科技。
Mine was much more high-tech.

823
00:45:06,800 --> 00:45:08,600
(Cow mooing)
(Cow mooing)

824
00:45:08,600 --> 00:45:11,300
等等，别闹，那是牛的声音。
No, wait, no, that's the cow.

825
00:45:11,300 --> 00:45:13,100
情况不太顺利……
Things were not going well...

826
00:45:13,100 --> 00:45:15,000
(Cacophony)
(Cacophony)

827
00:45:15,000 --> 00:45:16,600
……随后更糟糕了。
...and then they got worse.

828
00:45:16,600 --> 00:45:19,600
♪ Berlin - Take My Breath Away ♪
♪ Berlin - Take My Breath Away ♪

829
00:45:19,600 --> 00:45:22,400
(Neighing)
—天哪！
(Neighing)
- Oh, God in heaven!

