00:45:22,400 --> 00:45:23,800
萌警小子们来了。
The Pet Cop Boys are here.

831
00:45:23,800 --> 00:45:26,700
是啊。
—等等，是警察。
Yeah.
- No, wait, The Police.

832
00:45:26,700 --> 00:45:28,900
好啊，警察要来了——警察。
Yeah, well, the police are coming -
the police.

833
00:45:28,900 --> 00:45:31,100
# Da-do-do-do, da-da-da-da #
# Da-do-do-do, da-da-da-da #

834
