你早就看见我来了吧？
立刻的。
You saw me coming, didn't you?
Straight away.

835
00:45:33,000 --> 00:45:34,950
警方面临的最大难题之一：
想在开蓝灯和双闪的情况下把人拦下来。
One of the biggest problems
the police face:

836
00:45:34,950 --> 00:45:36,950
我装了好多蓝灯和双闪——他们会看到我来了。
trying to get somebody out of the
way with blues and twos on.

837
00:45:37,000 --> 00:45:40,000
好吧，我们得问一下，行吗？
I've got a lot of blues and twos -
they will see me coming.

838
00:45:40,000 --> 00:45:41,400
你注意到了。
—是啊，这可是……
Well, we've gotta ask, OK?

839
00:45:41,400 --> 00:45:43,300
太聪明了。这招扎人心。
You noticed that.
- Yeah, this is...

840
00:45:43,300 --> 00:45:45,700
It's genius. It's a stinger.
It's genius. It's a stinger.

841
00:45:45,700 --> 00:45:49,300
好吧，你收到无线电里传来的消息，可能得拦下一名坏蛋。
OK, you get word over your radio
that you might need to stop a baddie.

842
00:45:49,300 --> 00:45:52,800
别倒车拦车，那真是太危险了，
Rather than pulling out and blocking
with your car, which is frankly dangerous,

843
00:45:52,800 --> 00:45:55,400
你只需要猛踩刹车，然后……
you just stop very quickly and then...

844
00:45:58,100 --> 00:46:01,600
那看起来分明是块踩脚垫，上面还钉了几根钉子，
It was unmistakably a doormat
with some nails in it,

845
00:46:01,600 --> 00:46:03,500
所以我们直接开过去了。
so we moved on.

846
00:46:04,600 --> 00:46:07,500
"警车得快。
"A police car has to be fast.

847
00:46:07,500 --> 00:46:09,600
看看你们的车有多快，
To see how quick your cars are,

848
00:46:09,600 --> 00:46:11,700
斯提格现在要来一圈计时赛
the Stig will now drive one timed lap

849
00:46:11,700 --> 00:46:16,900
驾驶英国警用标准的Vauxhall Astra柴油车。
in the standard British police issue
Vauxhall Astra diesel.

850
00:46:16,900 --> 00:46:19,900
